OL,3,GNEWSAWoman detained in Egypt over
OL,4,A'sister's activism'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother-of-four from Birmingham has
OL,7,Fbeen detained by the Egyptian
OL,8,Fauthorities, with her husband and
OL,9,Flawyer claiming it is due to her
OL,10,Fsister's online activism.
OL,12,FEman el-Shazly, 45, from Handsworth
OL,13,FWood, was taken from her mother's house
OL,14,Fin Cairo in the early hours of Monday
OL,15,F17 August. Her husband, Zeesharn
OL,16,FMoustapha, said this was 24 hours after
OL,17,FEgyptian security forces "ram-raided"
OL,18,Fthe property and told her: "You need to
OL,19,Ftell your sister to stop".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
